# ER/EER Model

```mermaid
erDiagram
 DEPARTMENTS ||--o{ EMPLOYEES : contains
 EMPLOYEES ||--o| APP_USERS : account
 EMPLOYEES ||--o{ ATTENDANCE : records
 EMPLOYEES ||--o{ LEAVE_REQUESTS : requests
 APP_USERS o|--o{ LEAVE_REQUESTS : decides
 EMPLOYEES ||--o{ PAYROLL : receives
 DEPARTMENTS { bigint department_id PK string department_name UK }
 EMPLOYEES { bigint employee_id PK string employee_code UK bigint department_id FK }
 APP_USERS { bigint user_id PK bigint employee_id FK string role }
 ATTENDANCE { bigint attendance_id PK bigint employee_id FK date attendance_date }
 LEAVE_REQUESTS { bigint leave_id PK bigint employee_id FK bigint approved_by FK }
 PAYROLL { bigint payroll_id PK bigint employee_id FK date pay_month }
```

## Cardinalities
- Department 1 : many Employees.
- Employee 1 : 0..1 App User.
- Employee 1 : many Attendance, Leave Requests and Payroll rows.
- App User 1 : many approved leave requests (optional approver).
